Cell["", "Text"],

Cell[TextData[{
  "Clearly each adjunction ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`\[Pi] : 
        F \[LeftTee] \(U : \
\[ScriptCapitalA]\[LongRightArrow]\[ScriptCapitalX]\)\)]],
  " includes an adjunction core as part of its data. Then it follows directly \
from the Yoneda lemma and the definitions (a) and (b) that the effect of ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`U\)]],
  " and ",
  Cell[BoxData[
      \(TraditionalForm\`F\)]],
  " on homs are as in (c) and (d)."
}], "Text"],

