    CounterBox["Section"],
    ".",
    
    CounterBox["Theorem"],
    ". "
  }], "TheoremLabel",
    TaggingRules:>{"CellLabel" -> True}],
  "An adjunction core extends to an adjunction if and only if one of the \
diagrams (",
  ButtonBox[
  CounterBox["Section", "XRef-Equation-121162956"],
